$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=smshev  LOC_AFTER=?

* Eventually at least half of the primes up to x are smooth-shifted: the threshold is |_ exp ( 4 + 1 / E ) _| + 1 + ( T + 2 ) ^ 2 + the Chebyshev threshold (Lean: `key` of smooth_shifted_weak).

